# =============================================================================
# NovaMart Git Ignore Rules
# Covers Java Maven multi-module, React Vite frontend, Python AI service, & OS
# =============================================================================

# --- Java & Maven Build Output ---
**/target/
target/
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.ear
*.nar
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

